    "does_not_support": [
      "The packet cannot establish true population success probability of one, multi-seed reproducibility, locked-test performance, performance at other N, or visual-policy generalization. P3 E has only 20 trials; its supplied 95% interval is approximately [0.839,1].",
      "P3 versus P1 is not a causal identification of the contact-gap target alone: joint diffusion dimensions and coupled denoising differ. The scores do not establish which P3 component caused the improvement.",
      "The selected images all belong to one C episode, not the E failures of other candidates, and cannot establish extrapolation contact mechanics or a new recovery design.",
      "Diagnostic distance thresholds are descriptive, not contact or phase oracles. Several successful E episodes never enter the 5 cm hand-to-observed-handle threshold, so a hard contact gate based on that diagnostic would be unsupported.",
      "Raw reported loss totals differ in auxiliary terms across candidates and do not supply a common quality ranking. P3 world-action clipping is frequent in E (about 0.5904 of steps) but coexists with 20/20 successes; the packet does not establish clipping as a failure cause or justify a new action remapping."
    ],
    "supports": [
      "On this fixed N5 seed0 development packet, the existing P3 cabinet-frame plus future-contact-gap/rail joint-diffusion combination succeeds on all 10 IID, all 20 C and all 20 E episodes, with zero recorded joint violations and zero exceptions.",
      "Cabinet-frame candidates transfer more successfully to this E set: P1 succeeds on 16/20 and P3 on 20/20, compared with B0 0/20 and world-action plus rail-target P2 3/20. This supports retaining the existing local-geometry package for further fixed-protocol evaluation.",
      "P3 has no observed failure mechanism in this packet requiring a new revision. Its E final observed goal-point distance averages 0.003242556246435395 m and its mean first-success step is 111.7.",
      "All four 201-record training curves reach update 20000, contain finite reported values, and decline to small losses with modest late fluctuations. There is no evident divergence motivating an architectural repair.",
      "The eight images consistently show approach and open-drawer endpoints in the single selected C episode. They are visually compatible with the scored endpoint summaries; B0 joint-limit failure remains a recorded numeric outcome, not something the images establish."
    ],
